config SPI_BCM2835
	bool "Broadcom BCM2835 SPI controller driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_BRCM_BCM2835_SPI_ENABLED
	select PINCTRL
	help
	  Enable the polled driver for the Broadcom BCM2835-family SPI
	  controller: SPI0 on the Raspberry Pi 40-pin header, and the
	  same IP behind SPI3..SPI6 on the BCM2711. Chip select is
	  driven via cs-gpios.
